flowchart TD
    %% External Sources and Configuration
    ExternalData[(Données\nExternes)] --> |JSON Payload| Parser[PayloadParser]
    Config[(Configuration\nMétadonnées)] --> |Chargement| Mapping[SystemFieldMapping]
    
    %% Processing Pipeline
    Parser --> |Parsed JSON| Mapping
    Mapping --> |Appliquer règles| Transform[TransformationEngine]
    
    %% Field Processing
    Transform --> |"Path Extraction\nDirect/Complex"| FieldProcessor[FieldProcessor]
    FieldProcessor --> |Pour chaque champ| Validator["RulesValidator\n(Business Logic)"]
    
    %% Build and Save
    Validator --> |Validé| Builder[SObjectBuilder]
    Builder --> |DML Operations| SF[(Salesforce\nCRM)]
    Validator -->|Erreurs| ErrorHandler[ErrorHandler]
    
    %% Styles
    classDef data fill:#f96,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#c9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef validation fill:#a7e,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#7bf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    
    class ExternalData,Config data
    class Parser,Mapping,Transform,FieldProcessor process
    class Validator,ErrorHandler validation
    class Builder,SF output 